<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ABSA APPOINTS NCUBE NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>ABSA APPOINTS NCUBE NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Amalgamated Banks of South Africa Ltd announced on Wednesday it had appointed Donald Ncube as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>Ncube, whose appointment is effective from September 1, is executive chairman of Real Africa Group and also holds directorships at Anglo American Industrial Corp , Oceana Fishing Group Ltd and Glaxo Wellcome South Africa.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
